{"seq":3,"slug":"international-trade","title":"国际贸易","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"国际贸易-简介\">国际贸易 简介</h1><p>国际贸易研究商品、服务和资本跨越国境流动的规律与制度安排。从大航海时代的香料贸易到今天的全球供应链，国与国之间的经济往来始终是推动增长、引发冲突和重塑国际秩序的关键力量。理解贸易，就是理解全球化背后的经济逻辑。</p>\n<p>本知识体系沿着&quot;理论—政策—金融—商务&quot;四条路径展开，帮助自学者从抽象模型到实务操作全面把握国际贸易的运作方式。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>贸易理论</strong>从李嘉图比较优势原理出发，经过赫克歇尔-俄林的要素禀赋分析，直至新贸易理论对规模经济和产品差异化的解释，揭示各国为何贸易以及谁从贸易中获益。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>贸易政策</strong>讨论关税、配额等传统保护工具的经济效应，分析区域贸易协定与多边谈判的博弈格局，并解读世贸组织的争端解决机制如何维护规则秩序。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>国际金融</strong>聚焦汇率决定理论、国际收支平衡表的分析框架以及跨境资本流动的动因与风险，这些知识将贸易领域与全球金融市场紧密衔接。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>国际商务</strong>回到企业视角，考察跨国公司的组织与战略、对外直接投资的区位选择以及全球供应链的管理挑战，为有志于从事国际业务的自学者提供实践导向的知识储备。</p>\n<p>建议自学者先从贸易理论建立分析直觉，再学习贸易政策理解制度约束，之后在国际金融和国际商务两章中选择更贴近自身方向的内容深入。关注实际贸易摩擦案例和国际经济新闻，有助于将理论与现实打通。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trade-theory","title":"贸易理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"comparative-advantage","title":"比较优势理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-theory/comparative-advantage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"heckscher-ohlin-model","title":"赫克歇尔-俄林模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-theory/heckscher-ohlin-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"new-trade-theory","title":"新贸易理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-theory/new-trade-theory"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"trade-policy","title":"贸易政策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tariffs-quotas","title":"关税与配额","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-policy/tariffs-quotas"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trade-agreements","title":"贸易协定","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-policy/trade-agreements"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wto-system","title":"WTO体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-policy/wto-system"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"international-finance","title":"国际金融","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/international-finance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exchange-rate-theory","title":"汇率理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/international-finance/exchange-rate-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"balance-of-payments","title":"国际收支","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/international-finance/balance-of-payments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"international-capital-flows","title":"国际资本流动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/international-finance/international-capital-flows"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"global-business","title":"国际商务","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/global-business","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multinational-enterprises","title":"跨国企业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/global-business/multinational-enterprises"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-border-investment","title":"跨境投资","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/global-business/cross-border-investment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-supply-chains","title":"全球供应链","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/global-business/global-supply-chains"}]}]}